{"text": "A friend of mine in the East once wrote to me and asked me to visit an old man named Simon Wheeler. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He wanted me to ask Wheeler about his childhood friend, the Reverend Leonidas W, Smiley. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Later I began to suspect that there was no such person and that my friend had played a trick on me. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He probably guessed that if I asked about Leonidas, Wheeler would remember a man named Jim Smiley and bore me nearly to death. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I found Simon Wheeler dozing comfortably by the stove in an old tavern in the mining camp of Angels. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He was fat and bald, and he had a gentle and simple look on his calm face. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I told him the reason why I had come, he backed me into a corner and blocked me there with his chair. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then he sat down and began a long story, which he told without smiling once or changing his quiet, gentle voice. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> He seemed to believe that the story was truly important and that its two heroes were men of great genius. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> To me, the funniest thing was the way he told such a silly story so seriously, so I let him go on without interrupting.", "alignment": {"characters": ["A", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", " ", "o", "f", " ", "m", "i", "n", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "E", "a", "s", "t", " ", "o", "n", "c", "e", " ", "w", "r", "o", "t", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "m", "e", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "a", "s", "k", "e", "d", " ", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "v", "i", "s", "i", "t", " ", "a", "n", " ", "o", "l", "d", " ", "m", "a", "n", " ", "n", "a", "m", "e", "d", " ", "S", "i", "m", "o", "n", " ", "W", "h", "e", "e", "l", "e", "r", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "H", "e", " ", "w", "a", "n", "t", "e", "d", " ", "m", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "a", "s", "k"